# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Store screenshots.
# The images that ship live where the stores read them, and only there:
#   fastlane/metadata/android/en-US/images/phoneScreenshots/   Google Play
#   fastlane/screenshots/en-US/                                App Store (fastlane deliver)
# Everything under screenshots/ is output of tool/screenshots.sh and is regenerable, so only
# its README is tracked. See screenshots/README.md.
/screenshots/*
!/screenshots/README.md
/_frame_preview.png



